WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Break the Walls (1-08)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Electric Color (1987)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:46.800
[Blistering Electric Guitar Intro]

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:52.500
Been counting the days in this neon cage

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:58.200
Smiling for the cameras on a plastic stage

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:03.600
They turned the synths up, drowned the sound

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:09.000
But you can't keep a good thing down

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:15.400
We're gonna break the walls tonight! (Yeah!)

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:21.400
Turn up the volume, hit the light!

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:26.800
No more whispers, time to shout

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:36.000
The Engine's roaring, let it out!

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:42.200
I'm tired of the glitter, tired of the gloss

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:48.000
Tired of the suits who think they're the boss

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:54.200
This guitar is loaded, it's ready to scream

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:59.900
Waking up from their pretty dream

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:06.200
We're gonna break the walls tonight! (Yeah!)

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.200
Turn up the volume, hit the light!

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:18.000
No more whispers, time to shout

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:25.300
The Engine's roaring, let it out!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:58.000
[Face-Melting Guitar Solo]

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:03.800
For every kid who feels the same

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:09.600
Trapped in a world, playing their game

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:15.400
This one's for you, this one's for me

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.900
Time to be free!

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:25.200
We're gonna break the walls tonight! (Yeah!)

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:31.200
Turn up the volume, hit the light!

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:36.800
No more whispers, time to shout

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:43.800
The Engine's roaring, let it out!

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:51.500
Let it out!

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:56.500
Break the walls!

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.500
C'mon!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:08.000
[Shredding Guitar Outro]
